{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06919","headline":"晦日马镫曲稍次中流作 · 常建","name":"晦日马镫曲稍次中流作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜寒宿芦苇，晓色明西林。\n初日在川上，便澄游子心。\n秦天无纤翳，郊野浮春阴。\n波静随钓鱼，舟小绿水深。\n出浦见千里，旷然谐远寻。\n扣船应渔父，因唱沧浪吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}